TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC with 50 mmol/kg Ca, heat 20->200C, calcite equil, report SI aragonite
SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50 as HCO3
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.csv
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -si Aragonite
END
